{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>You shall have no other elohim.</b> Even though you accept My sovereignty, do not serve any besides Me — like a servant who serves the king's servant — as it says: יְרֵאִים אֶת יְהוָה וְאֶת אֱלֹהֵיהֶם הָיוּ עֹבְדִים (II Kings 17:33)." "<b>Before My face.</b> For one does not share honor with servants in the king's presence — and I am in every place, equally present in one mode."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:24.861948941Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}